  "_about": "Sample authority registry after the one operator-reviewed inventory of the agentic-systems workspace (proposal v7, section 2.3; workspace mode as of proposal v11, section 2.8). Lives under the CodeFlow authority root (macOS: <home from the user database>/Library/Application Support/codeflow/bindings.json), never in a repository. Written only by operator commands. Observed on 2026-09-28: codeflow, agent-os and agent-workstation-kit carry .codeflow/policy.json; agent-os-portal and agentic-development-model are git repositories without it; project-organization-guide and design are plain folders. The two exclusions are the operator's decision, shown here as proposed. Workspace mode: the umbrella's own .codeflow/policy.json sets git.root_branch to \"integration/workspace\" (the CodeFlow convention, applied by `codeflow init --workspace`; for this workspace a post-release adoption step, RELEASE-PLAN.md:546). The registry does not record it; doctor reads the key from the umbrella's policy and compares the umbrella's harness preset with each enrolled child below.",
